# Force LF line endings for files that MUST be interpreted by a
# Unix shell. Without this, repositories cloned on Windows with the
# default ``core.autocrlf=true`` would land bash scripts with CRLF
# line endings, and ``/usr/bin/env bash`` chokes with
# ``/usr/bin/env\r: No such file or directory`` on WSL / Linux.
*.sh text eol=lf
